Muchuu de tobikonda sekai wa seikai da
The world you blindly jumped into must be right

00:01:31.630 --> 00:01:35.790
REASON FOR LIVING

00:05:46.290 --> 00:05:48.290
Kanagawa School of Medical Science

00:05:46.290 --> 00:05:48.290
Secondary Hospital

00:11:02.750 --> 00:11:04.420
KUZURYU

00:22:01.330 --> 00:22:04.580
Tsutaetai anata e 
I want to convey them to you

00:22:04.580 --> 00:22:07.250
Sarakedasu omoi o
Lay all of my feelings bare

00:22:07.250 --> 00:22:13.790
Uso demo tsumi demo waratteite hoshikute
Whether I have to lie or sin, I just want you to smile

00:22:14.170 --> 00:22:16.750
Anata ga kureta kono tsubasa de
By using these wings that you gave me

00:22:17.040 --> 00:22:19.710
Tsunagu "yakusoku" o dakishimete
And embracing the "promise" that ties us together

00:22:19.710 --> 00:22:23.540
Sora e nobase yo!
I'll stretch up to the sky!

00:22:23.540 --> 00:22:26.460
Tada hikari sasu hou e 
Towards where only light shines

00:22:28.670 --> 00:22:32.130
Iki o koroshite itanda 
I was suffocating myself

00:22:34.210 --> 00:22:37.960
Kago no naka no katasumi de 
In the empty corner of a cage

00:22:37.960 --> 00:22:39.710
Aa... maru de
Yeah... it was as if

00:22:39.960 --> 00:22:43.170
"Habatakenai tori no you da" 
"I'm just like a bird that can't fly"

00:22:43.170 --> 00:22:49.000
Iiwake bakari tozashite shimai sou de
I nearly locked myself in with all the excuses

00:22:49.790 --> 00:22:51.080
Kawaritai 
I want to change

00:22:51.080 --> 00:22:52.630
Kawarenai 
I cannot change

00:22:52.630 --> 00:22:55.420
Uso ni mamiretemo
Even if I become stained in lies

00:22:55.540 --> 00:22:56.790
Kowaretai
I want to fall apart

00:22:56.790 --> 00:22:58.000
Kowasanai 
I cannot fall apart

00:22:58.000 --> 00:23:00.420
Ima... tobidase
Now... I set flight

00:23:00.880 --> 00:23:03.790
Oozora e hirogeta
Sailing into the open sky

00:23:03.790 --> 00:23:06.460
Minikui tsubasa de
On these ugly wings

00:23:06.460 --> 00:23:13.170
Mou nitodo to itami o kurikaesanai you ni 
To assure I never go through the same pain again

00:23:13.460 --> 00:23:16.040
Konna ni mo moroku hakanakute
Still so very fragile and ephemeral

00:23:16.290 --> 00:23:18.920
Donna ni mo kegare buzama demo 
But no matter how dirty or pathetic

00:23:19.210 --> 00:23:22.750
Agake! Agareyo!
I'll fight! I'll rise!

00:23:22.750 --> 00:23:26.380
Wazukani kagayaku hou e
Towards where there is a tiny glimmer

00:23:31.000 --> 00:23:35.420
Ahiru no Sora

00:23:31.000 --> 00:23:35.420
